  "label": "Hypersexualization Stereotype",
  "description": "A harmful stereotype that portrays Black men as inherently sexually aggressive or hypersexual, reducing their value to sexual performance. This stereotype is often used to demean and dehumanize Black men, and is reinforced by media and cultural narratives that focus on their sexual behavior rather than their full humanity or diverse capabilities.",
